     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span>: Yellow is a primary color.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"p\"></span> is true.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\sim}p\"></span> is false.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span>: Green is a primary color.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span> is false.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\sim}p \\vee r\"></span></p>\n<p>A disjunction is only false when both statements are false.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\rm False \\vee False = False\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "False"
    }
