     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Given statements:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span>: Blue is a primary color.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q\"></span> is true.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span>: Green is a primary color.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"r\"></span> is false.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"q \\vee r\"></span></p>\n<p>A disjunction is only false when both statements are false.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\rm True \\vee False = True\"></span></p>"
    },
